  "description": "Modern owner-drawn WinForms UI toolkit for .NET Framework 4.7.2. Provides 40+ styled controls including buttons (solid + outlined variants), text fields, currency/integer/percent inputs, date picker, time picker, combo box, toggle, data grid with search/pagination/sort/tabs/edit buttons, snackbar toasts, message box, spinner, progress bar, badges, cards, banners, status indicators, navigation (left nav + top nav), and more. All controls feature consistent theming with rounded corners, clean typography, and modern visual design.",
